## Geneva County, Alabama Cemeteries

This list of Geneva County cemeteries was compiled
from highway maps which can be viewed at [alabamamaps.ua.edu][] 
or the most recent map is available in [pdf][co31pdf] or
paper form from the Alabama Department of Transportation.

[alabamamaps.ua.edu]: http://alabamamaps.ua.edu/historicalmaps/counties/geneva/geneva.html
[co31pdf]: https://aldotgis.dot.state.al.us/GeneralHighwayPDF/web/co31.pdf

The <cite>Historical Atlas of Alabama Volume II: Cemetery
Locations by County, 3rd Edition</cite>
contains cemetery locations for each county and can
be purchased from the [University of Alabama][].

[University of Alabama]: http://alabamamaps.ua.edu/cartlab/publications/

